<title>UK: Reed to buy Dutch publisher in few weeks.</title>
<headline>Reed to buy Dutch publisher in few weeks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Dutch publishing group Reed-Elsevier said on Monday that it expects to complete the purchase of Dutch publishing firm Colofon BV in a few weeks.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that it is at an advanced stage of discussions with Colofon shareholders.</p>
<p>Reed-Elsevier expects the acquisition to enhance earnings in the first year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
